Third-party material

Per-file asset attribution (author, source, license) is maintained in ASSETS.md and ATTRIBUTION.md.
Every asset committed to this repository is checked by `cargo xtask assets` (part of `cargo xtask ci`).

Builds made with optional bundled fonts (`LUMENCRAFT_FONTS_DIR`) embed SIL Open Font License 1.1
font faces from `$LUMENCRAFT_FONTS_DIR/fonts/` and ship their license texts alongside the release
packages as `OFL-<family>.txt`. Builds without `LUMENCRAFT_FONTS_DIR` embed none of them.
